Description
Pipes transport free-flowing materials between the objects FluidSource 
 , Tank 
 , Mixer 
 , Portioner
, DePortioner 
 , and FluidDrain 
 .
Insert the objects with which you would like to model. Connect the Pipes with Connectors with the
PatchMatrix.
Double-click the PatchMatrix and change to the tab Attributes. Click Connections and select the
respective check boxes to allow materials to flow through these Pipes. The column header contains the
incoming pipes, the row header contains the outgoing pipes.
